Welcome to the official development roadmap and conceptual documentation hub for the **Creationist Entanglement Theory (CET)** ecosystem. This living manifesto tracks our systematic shift away from the matter-first, reductionist traps of "existing physics" toward a top-down, constraint-first reality.

